# The states (bow.clip keys, per facing): `nock` the crank (spanned, no bolt), `draw` and `full` the aim (spanned, the bolt
# on the tiller), `low` the drawn idle (as the aim), `release` the shot (the string forward against the prod, no bolt);
# `carry` the slack bow level in hand; `drop` flat by a corpse's hand. Facing D the prod is across, the bolt at the camera.
